OL,3,GNEWSAMuseum seeks #29k for WW2
OL,4,A'greatest raid' medals
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe National Maritime Museum Cornwall
OL,7,F(NMMC) said it was hoping to raise
OL,8,F#29,151 for a specialist case to house
OL,9,Fthe medals, including Beattie's
OL,10,FVictoria Cross, to display them next
OL,11,Fyear.
